  "description": "A managed IL2P v0.6 codec for .NET: encodes/decodes AX.25 frames to and from the IL2P wire format (Type 0/1 headers, the packet-synchronous scrambler, Reed-Solomon FEC, block segmentation) including the IL2P+CRC extension, plus a streaming bit-level deframer. Dire-Wolf / NinoTNC interoperable. Extracted from the pdn-soundmodem packet-radio modem.",
